re in Europe.", "CAMESSELLE-TEIJEIRO:Cameselle-Teijeiro is an author who contributed to the new WHO classification of thyroid tumors.", "LLOYD RV:Lloyd RV is a prominent researcher who plays a significant role in the development of the NANETS guidelines for neuroendocrine tumors. In addition to this, Lloyd RV serves as an editor for the WHO Classification of Tumours of Endocrine Organs, a comprehensive resource that encompasses various types of endocrine tumors, including those of the thyroid. Through these contributions, Lloyd RV is actively involved in advancing the understanding and classification of endocrine-related neoplasms.", "RADIOLGY:", "IARC:The International Agency for Research on Cancer (IARC) is an intergovernmental agency that is part of the World Health Organization (WHO) and focuses on cancer research and classification.", "JAMA ONCOL:JAMA Oncology is a peer-reviewed medical journal that focuses on publishing research and reviews related to oncology and cancer treatment. The journal covers a wide range of topics within the field, including specific studies on various types of cancer, such as head and neck cancer."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}